<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  OriginOS Toolkit — notification small icon.

  Status-bar icons are masks, not pictures: the system keeps only the alpha
  channel and repaints it in the bar's own colour. So this is a silhouette of
  the gear at 24dp — eight teeth and a bored hub — with no colour of its own and
  no gloss. Using the launcher foreground here instead (as this app used to)
  hands the system a 108dp full-colour drawing and lets it decide, which is how
  status-bar icons end up as grey blobs.
-->
